WEBVTT

00:19.954 --> 00:24.258
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.258 --> 00:28.929
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.929 --> 00:36.637
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.637 --> 00:41.475
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.475 --> 00:52.252
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.252 --> 00:54.355
Mamoritai

00:54.355 --> 00:56.623
Shinjitai

00:56.623 --> 01:00.928
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.928 --> 01:05.232
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.232 --> 01:09.536
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.536 --> 01:13.140
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:13.140 --> 01:21.741
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:31.225 --> 01:34.922
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:40.200 --> 01:42.191
Darn you!

01:46.707 --> 01:49.870
Grab the Sign Emerging
from the Darkness

01:58.419 --> 02:02.014
Grandfather, are you
coming back soon?

02:02.856 --> 02:06.257
You had said you'd return
as soon as possible...

02:12.466 --> 02:15.731
Grandfather, you abandoned me.

02:17.871 --> 02:19.998
The sound of a hammer?

02:20.941 --> 02:22.841
Grandfather!

02:23.477 --> 02:27.573
You're mean, Grandfather!
How could you leave me here...

02:30.050 --> 02:31.518
I can't breathe...

02:31.518 --> 02:33.748
So heavy...

02:35.155 --> 02:37.391
So heavy... I can't breathe...

02:37.391 --> 02:40.417
Grandfather, you're heartless!

02:42.096 --> 02:43.723
What?

02:46.333 --> 02:47.891
A mononoke...

02:48.869 --> 02:50.632
A mononoke!

02:51.572 --> 02:53.073
Oh...

02:53.073 --> 02:56.270
The mononoke is
actually Mokkun...

02:56.877 --> 02:59.379
Don't call me a mononoke!

02:59.379 --> 03:01.582
Did something happen?

03:01.582 --> 03:04.051
I had a dream about Kifune.

03:04.051 --> 03:07.154
Kifune? Kifune of
Kifune Mountain?

03:07.154 --> 03:08.689
That's it.

03:08.689 --> 03:12.192
I dreamt about the night
my grandfather abandoned me...

03:12.192 --> 03:14.660
at the Kifune Shrine
when I was young.

03:15.462 --> 03:18.198
Listen, Mokkun.
That old man said,

03:18.198 --> 03:20.667
"I have work to do.
Wait here for me."

03:20.667 --> 03:25.036
Then he just left after tying
me to a tree with a rope.

03:25.539 --> 03:27.407
Kifune was quiet at night,

03:27.407 --> 03:30.277
but the sound of a hammer
hitting a nail...

03:30.277 --> 03:32.880
could be heard coming
from somewhere.

03:32.880 --> 03:34.882
After leaving me alone
in a place like that,

03:34.882 --> 03:37.951
Grandfather returned
only the next morning!

03:37.951 --> 03:39.887
He smiled and said,
"Sorry, sorry.

03:39.887 --> 03:42.990
I had work to do and
couldn't come back."

03:42.990 --> 03:45.526
I no longer believed
his words after that.

03:45.526 --> 03:50.964
Masahiro, don't you have to
go to the onmyou dorms now?

04:04.978 --> 04:08.243
That's one of Grandfather's
shikigami, right?

04:22.095 --> 04:23.964
Mokkun?

04:23.964 --> 04:28.060
- What's wrong, Mokkun?
- S-Sorry, what is it?

04:29.336 --> 04:31.338
Who's that?

04:31.338 --> 04:34.975
He's Seiryuu, one of the
12 Shikigami Spirit.

04:34.975 --> 04:37.177
He seems to be
quite angry.

04:37.177 --> 04:41.014
Just ignore him. He hates me.

04:41.014 --> 04:43.917
Just ignore him.

04:43.917 --> 04:47.045
Hey, you'll be late
if you don't hurry.

04:53.327 --> 04:57.991
Touda, you traitor in
a fake form.

04:58.665 --> 05:01.065
I will never forgive you.

05:12.879 --> 05:16.713
This heat is insane.

05:17.317 --> 05:21.288
Oh, Masahiro. You're
hard at work today too.

05:21.288 --> 05:24.258
Yes. I'm delivering letters
to the court music division.

05:24.258 --> 05:26.860
Geez, it's a hot day, isn't it?

05:26.860 --> 05:29.062
Yes, I totally agree.

05:29.062 --> 05:32.966
It hasn't rained in almost
two months.

05:32.966 --> 05:36.003
A drought is inevitable
if it doesn't rain soon.

05:36.003 --> 05:38.138
Well, before a drought happens,

05:38.138 --> 05:42.409
the Mikado will pray to the
dragon deity of Kifune.

05:42.409 --> 05:44.478
- Kifune...
- Oh, yes.

05:44.478 --> 05:48.448
I saw Master Seimei in
the vicinity just now.

05:48.448 --> 05:50.484
The Kikou Festival is nearing,

05:50.484 --> 05:53.153
so he must have come
to make preparations.

05:53.153 --> 05:56.490
Well, Seimei is so busy
every year.

05:56.490 --> 06:00.460
If you consider his age,
it's really quite amazing.

06:00.460 --> 06:02.663
That's because he's
a transformed raccoon.

06:02.663 --> 06:04.927
Don't trust him
so easily!

06:09.469 --> 06:11.733
Here are some letters from
the onmyou dorms.

06:13.140 --> 06:15.005
Thank you.

06:19.212 --> 06:22.477
Wait, Mokkun!
Where are you going?

06:30.624 --> 06:32.659
Mokkun, what's wrong?

06:32.659 --> 06:35.462
Bah! Who does Abe
no Seimei think he is?

06:35.462 --> 06:38.398
Putting on airs though
he's just an onmyouji.

06:38.398 --> 06:40.567
The Minister of the Left
trusts him.

06:40.567 --> 06:44.237
He's apparently an
impressive onmyouji.

06:44.237 --> 06:47.274
It seems that no one
knows his birth lineage.

06:47.274 --> 06:49.676
People have said that
his mother was a fox.

06:49.676 --> 06:52.512
I can't believe we have to
rely on someone like that.

06:52.512 --> 06:56.249
But if you speak bad about him,
you'll be killed by a curse.

06:56.249 --> 07:00.447
Well... That's scary,
that's scary.

07:06.159 --> 07:08.184
What happened?
What happened?!

07:14.401 --> 07:17.170
We have trouble!
An ayakashi has appeared!

07:17.170 --> 07:19.873
C-Call an onmyouji...
Call Master Seimei!

07:19.873 --> 07:22.843
An ayakashi...
An ayakashi was here.

07:22.843 --> 07:24.868
An ayakashi?

07:32.853 --> 07:34.343
Oh!

07:34.788 --> 07:37.524
What is it, Masahiro?

07:37.524 --> 07:39.025
This... This guy's...

07:39.025 --> 07:40.549
Kyuuki
This... This guy's...

07:45.298 --> 07:47.823
Kyuuki?

07:48.402 --> 07:51.037
A powerful demon from
the West.

07:51.037 --> 07:53.938
I wonder where
his hiding place is.

08:01.047 --> 08:02.649
- Hurry!
- We're in trouble!

08:02.649 --> 08:05.447
It'll catch up with us soon!

08:34.347 --> 08:38.051
All right... Where should
we patrol tonight?

08:38.051 --> 08:40.287
You know, Masahiro...

08:40.287 --> 08:43.223
Why don't you go and
get some sleep?

08:43.223 --> 08:45.625
You've been working in the
onmyou dorms in the day,

08:45.625 --> 08:48.361
and searching for Kyuuki
at night.

08:48.361 --> 08:52.499
It's okay. I took a short nap
after dinner.

08:52.499 --> 08:54.768
Besides, I've already
boasted to Grandfather...

08:54.768 --> 08:57.037
that I'd find and exorcise
Kyuuki quickly.

08:57.037 --> 08:59.767
But even so...

09:05.378 --> 09:09.816
You guys... You fall
on me every night.

09:09.816 --> 09:13.386
You're searching for the demon
from the West, right?

09:13.386 --> 09:15.822
Hurry and get rid of it.

09:15.822 --> 09:19.826
We found comrades that
were ripped in half tonight.

09:19.826 --> 09:23.230
- Where did that happen?
- North of Ukyo.

09:23.230 --> 09:25.732
But there were no traces
of its aura left.

09:25.732 --> 09:28.568
It suddenly appears and
vanishes immediately.

09:28.568 --> 09:32.772
- Don't you think it's scary?
- What are you going to do?

09:32.772 --> 09:36.643
Let's have a look. I'm not sure
if we'll find any clues though.

09:36.643 --> 09:39.779
We're begging you.
Please get rid of it soon!

09:39.779 --> 09:42.415
We're counting on you,
Seimei's grandson!

09:42.415 --> 09:44.212
Don't call me grandson!

09:48.188 --> 09:51.691
This should be the place the
minor demons were talking about.

09:51.691 --> 09:53.026
Yeah...

09:53.026 --> 09:58.431
But there's no sign of
the monster's aura at all.

09:58.431 --> 10:01.835
Yeah, it's extremely cautious.

10:01.835 --> 10:04.599
Completely removing
all traces of its aura.

10:22.155 --> 10:25.147
[chant]

10:28.895 --> 10:32.499
- He got away.
- He doesn't seem to be injured.

10:32.499 --> 10:36.333
- He's just unconscious.
- That ayakashi was...

10:36.403 --> 10:39.172
It's still running.

10:39.172 --> 10:40.807
That's bad!

10:40.807 --> 10:43.799
The imperial palace...
is in that direction!

10:58.391 --> 10:59.960
Wait!

10:59.960 --> 11:02.429
You have to be near it
to use your spells.

11:02.429 --> 11:04.192
I know!

11:13.239 --> 11:14.866
All right!

11:30.123 --> 11:33.293
That ayakashi doesn't seem
to be very clever...

11:33.293 --> 11:34.726
Yeah...

11:36.229 --> 11:38.231
Wait!

11:38.231 --> 11:40.791
I do not know the path ahead...

11:42.569 --> 11:44.799
[chant]

11:46.773 --> 11:49.435
- Don't be complacent!
- I know!

11:50.777 --> 11:53.439
[chant]

11:56.716 --> 11:58.411
Hey.

12:02.756 --> 12:05.325
- Is it crying?
- But...

12:05.325 --> 12:08.028
It tried to attack
a person back there.

12:08.028 --> 12:10.588
We should probably ask it
for the reason.

12:14.434 --> 12:18.894
Don't be afraid of us.
Why did you attack a human?

12:26.146 --> 12:27.647
What is it, Mokkun?

12:27.647 --> 12:31.518
Masahiro, exorcise this
demon right now!

12:31.518 --> 12:34.254
This coward is a disgrace
to demons!

12:34.254 --> 12:38.224
- Exorcise it, exorcise it!
- Wait, Mokkun.

12:38.224 --> 12:40.360
What did it say?

12:40.360 --> 12:43.530
It was walking in town when
it saw a drunk who had fallen.

12:43.530 --> 12:47.167
It checked on him, but the drunk
was so surprised he fainted.

12:47.167 --> 12:49.602
Then it became scared
and ran away...

12:49.602 --> 12:51.404
because an onmyouji appeared!

12:51.404 --> 12:54.805
By onmyouji, was it
referring to me?

12:57.744 --> 13:00.146
What a coward...

13:00.146 --> 13:01.581
That's pathetic!

13:01.581 --> 13:04.818
If you're a demon, behave
like one and brace up!

13:04.818 --> 13:06.786
Be strong! Shape up!

13:06.786 --> 13:09.414
I can't believe it!
It's not a bad demon.

13:13.259 --> 13:16.896
Unbind the immovable rope,
loosen now.

13:16.896 --> 13:18.796
[chant]

13:23.269 --> 13:25.169
You can go now.

13:27.707 --> 13:30.477
You don't have to bow
to me.

13:30.477 --> 13:32.979
Next time, if you're going
to walk around town,

13:32.979 --> 13:34.606
do it in a less crowded place.

13:35.482 --> 13:38.351
Bye, Kurumanosuke!

13:38.351 --> 13:41.047
When did you give it
a name?

13:41.521 --> 13:43.614
I'm glad it was
a good demon.

13:44.390 --> 13:46.620
There he is!

13:47.594 --> 13:50.296
Will you please stop
raining on me?!

13:50.296 --> 13:51.765
Trouble!

13:51.765 --> 13:54.427
Another comrade of ours
was killed!

14:08.581 --> 14:12.881
The foreign ayakashi's aura is
totally gone, as we'd expected.

14:13.386 --> 14:16.256
- If only I'd realized...
- It's impossible!

14:16.256 --> 14:18.691
Even I didn't realize
this was happening.

14:18.691 --> 14:21.455
I have to train even harder.

14:33.239 --> 14:35.742
What can a kid like him
possibly do?

14:35.742 --> 14:40.346
What's wrong, Seiryuu?
Why are you so angry?

14:40.346 --> 14:43.416
Is the kid who plays carelessly
with minor demons,

14:43.416 --> 14:47.387
and who can't even feel
the aura of the foreign demon,

14:47.387 --> 14:50.690
truly chosen as your heir,
Seimei?

14:50.690 --> 14:52.592
Yes, that's right.

14:52.592 --> 14:55.728
He is my one and
only heir.

14:55.728 --> 14:59.032
Guren acknowledged that
and is with him now.

14:59.032 --> 15:01.534
I don't agree with anything
that Touda says.

15:01.534 --> 15:05.939
Seimei, I'll acknowledge no one
as my master, but you.

15:05.939 --> 15:08.241
I don't plan to take
instructions from that kid.

15:08.241 --> 15:11.044
I didn't say it would
happen right away.

15:11.044 --> 15:14.080
But someday in the
near future, I will die.

15:14.080 --> 15:16.950
And then everything
will be okay.

15:16.950 --> 15:18.518
You're so stubborn.

15:18.518 --> 15:21.654
When that happens,
I'll give up being a shikigami,

15:21.654 --> 15:23.389
and return to my former world.

15:23.389 --> 15:28.190
I refuse to trust a kid...
that Touda has acknowledged.

15:30.430 --> 15:33.194
Please listen to Seiryuu's
words.

15:33.867 --> 15:36.703
We cannot forgive
Touda either.

15:36.703 --> 15:40.707
It may have happened a long
time ago in the human world.

15:40.707 --> 15:44.310
But to us, it seemed to have
happened only yesterday.

15:44.310 --> 15:46.779
You owe it to your good luck...

15:46.779 --> 15:48.974
that you are still here now.

15:49.916 --> 15:51.651
Well...

15:51.651 --> 15:55.388
Even a shikigami spirit
believes in luck.

15:55.388 --> 15:59.192
But that wasn't luck.
It was my destiny.

15:59.192 --> 16:01.786
But that will end soon.

16:02.228 --> 16:04.297
Master Seimei...

16:04.297 --> 16:07.700
All living things
undergo changes.

16:07.700 --> 16:11.604
Trees and flowers change
their shape when it's time.

16:11.604 --> 16:14.596
The same theory applies
to people's hearts.

16:15.074 --> 16:18.945
That is true even for those
in a family of deities.

16:18.945 --> 16:20.947
Guren is no exception.

16:20.947 --> 16:24.484
We are here now because of all
the misunderstandings we had.

16:24.484 --> 16:27.687
If one has a heart,
one has feelings.

16:27.687 --> 16:33.751
Do you really think that
Guren feels nothing about this?

16:34.160 --> 16:37.397
You should reconsider
if you think so.

16:37.397 --> 16:40.166
You would be making
a big mistake.

16:40.166 --> 16:42.769
Tell that to the others as well.

16:42.769 --> 16:45.605
My heir is Masahiro.

16:45.605 --> 16:48.942
He's the only one who's
able to become my heir.

16:48.942 --> 16:52.679
I hope you will understand
in time to come.

16:52.679 --> 16:54.840
Is that really so?

17:02.889 --> 17:05.289
You are here too, Rikugou?

17:09.896 --> 17:12.694
The future doesn't
seem optimistic.

17:22.275 --> 17:23.708
Grandfather...

17:24.243 --> 17:25.945
Now then...

17:25.945 --> 17:29.649
Kyuuki and the rest aren't
revealing themselves.

17:29.649 --> 17:33.353
- Yes.
- However...

17:33.353 --> 17:36.589
You had said that you'd
defeat them on your own.

17:36.589 --> 17:39.993
And that you'd do it while
keeping the matter under wraps.

17:39.993 --> 17:41.961
Yes.

17:41.961 --> 17:44.452
I'll do... my best.

17:45.665 --> 17:48.334
- By the way, Masahiro.
- Yes?

17:48.334 --> 17:50.203
You used a spell
this afternoon...

17:50.203 --> 17:53.106
to scare the government
officials, right?

17:53.106 --> 17:55.808
W-What? How did you?

17:55.808 --> 17:57.844
What were you thinking of?!

17:57.844 --> 18:01.143
N-No, well... That was...

18:02.348 --> 18:04.784
I can't believe you
used a spell...

18:04.784 --> 18:07.787
to scare people in
the Imperial Palace.

18:07.787 --> 18:10.881
You used to be a nice,
obedient child in the past...

18:12.859 --> 18:14.918
Is that so?

18:15.628 --> 18:19.265
Didn't you learn anything
from my teachings?

18:19.265 --> 18:23.403
If you're going to do such things,
I can't die even if I wanted to!

18:23.403 --> 18:25.538
Stop joking around!
I apologize...

18:25.538 --> 18:27.807
for using a spell to
play a prank.

18:27.807 --> 18:31.607
There won't be a second time.
I'll be prudent from now.

18:33.012 --> 18:34.536
Geez!

18:38.017 --> 18:40.987
He seems to be
feeling better.

18:40.987 --> 18:43.089
He'll go into a frenzy
in his room again.

18:43.089 --> 18:46.525
Guren, please forgive Seiryuu.

18:48.661 --> 18:50.930
I should be asking for
his forgiveness instead.

18:50.930 --> 18:53.866
I'm the one who should
be blamed.

18:53.866 --> 18:56.169
I violated the rules
for a shikigami,

18:56.169 --> 18:58.438
and committed an offence.

18:58.438 --> 19:02.542
Well, all that's happened
is in the past.

19:02.542 --> 19:04.644
Masahiro is here now.

19:04.644 --> 19:09.348
With his character, things will
probably be easier for you.

19:09.348 --> 19:12.283
I don't think so. Probably...

19:12.952 --> 19:17.753
Masahiro, I'm hiding
something from you.

19:19.759 --> 19:24.560
I, Touda, once tried to
take Abe no Seimei's life.

19:25.832 --> 19:28.266
That old raccoon!

19:28.668 --> 19:32.968
I will definitely surpass
him one day!

19:35.108 --> 19:39.306
And that day...
has to come quickly.

19:41.714 --> 19:45.051
Well! You made a big mess
in the room again.

19:45.051 --> 19:46.985
Sorry.

19:48.187 --> 19:52.180
I'm the one who
cleans up, so...

19:53.726 --> 19:58.390
- What is it?
- Mokkun, you look very troubled.

19:58.965 --> 20:01.467
What's wrong?
You have a stomachache?

20:01.467 --> 20:02.935
That's not it.

20:02.935 --> 20:06.539
You should always say so
when something hurts.

20:06.539 --> 20:10.977
Nobody would know unless
it's someone who can see you.

20:10.977 --> 20:13.946
The feeling will never go away
if you keep quiet.

20:21.087 --> 20:24.023
Darn you, darn you, darn you!

20:24.023 --> 20:26.924
How annoying!

20:28.161 --> 20:31.722
Master, what happened
while we were away?

20:42.542 --> 20:45.978
Although he's still young,
this kid is a priest.

20:45.978 --> 20:48.381
An onmyouji, as
he's known as here.

20:48.381 --> 20:49.916
A person like that!

20:49.916 --> 20:51.884
All those gathered here...

20:51.884 --> 20:55.388
are willing to sacrifice
their bodies.

20:55.388 --> 20:57.390
Gaku! But their power alone...

20:57.390 --> 21:00.026
is not enough to heal
our master's wound.

21:00.026 --> 21:04.986
Shun, I know!
But a good sacrifice is...

21:07.900 --> 21:10.536
Master, in order to
heal your wound,

21:10.536 --> 21:12.738
that girl is necessary
after all.

21:12.738 --> 21:16.509
She is a suitable sacrifice
for you, Master!

21:16.509 --> 21:18.778
We will go bring her
back for you!

21:18.778 --> 21:20.646
Do as you want.

21:20.646 --> 21:24.217
I will take a rest.

21:24.217 --> 21:26.082
We understand.

21:42.902 --> 21:54.146
Fukai yami no naka de
kimi no koe ga kikoeta

21:54.146 --> 22:05.758
"Shinjiteru" tada hitokoto
boku no kokoro ni hibiite kita

22:05.758 --> 22:11.497
Itsumo kimi ga soba ni
ite kureta ne

22:11.497 --> 22:16.992
Itsumo boku ni
yuuki kurete ita

22:19.272 --> 22:29.682
Boku-tachi no mirai wo
mamoritsuzukeru tame ni

22:29.682 --> 22:36.489
Taisetsu na kimi ni
yakusokusuru yo

22:36.489 --> 22:41.661
Boku wa akiramenai

22:41.661 --> 22:47.433
Motto motto boku
wa boku wo koete

22:47.433 --> 22:54.396
Kitto kitto kitto

23:00.112 --> 23:02.637
Next Episode

23:24.103 --> 23:25.671
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.671 --> 23:26.806
Episode 7.

23:26.806 --> 23:26.839
Episode 7
A Woman's Desires
Roped in from Beyond
Episode 7.

23:26.839 --> 23:29.171
Episode 7
A Woman's Desires
Roped in from Beyond
A Woman's Desires
Roped in from Beyond.
